# MODE in the middle of a fast load: the FPGA goes silent 4 KB into the ROM
# (reloading from flash), the rest of the load streams into the void, and
# the firmware comes back to the menu with the link at 2M and reboots.
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "game.gba"
press down
arm-silence-rom 4096 8000
press a
wait-reset
expect-screen "TangCore"
expect-cursor-row 9
